save_set: a save of one node (VACASK's save governs the operating point, its sweeps and the transient) before an operating point and a DC sweep of a divider: both simulators write v(out) alone
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
v1 (in 0) vsource dc=1.0
r1 (in out) resistor r=1k
r2 (out mid) resistor r=3k
r3 (mid 0) resistor r=1k
control
  save v(out)
  analysis op1 op
  sweep s1 instance="v1" parameter="dc" from=0.0 to=5.0 step=0.25
    analysis dc1 op
endc
